# Meatieroids's art, copied from deion_assets by scripts/sync_sprites.py — the only way
# art enters this game. Run it from this repo's root:
#
#     python3 deion_assets/scripts/sync_sprites.py .
#
# and `--check` to prove the copies still match the pinned commit below (the
# working set's scripts/check-sprite-sync.sh runs that over every game).
#
# The startup cards and the engine's window icon, then the game's own: the three
# meatieroids, the two Flying Funks seen from above, their shots, the star tile, and the title art.
# The quarantined `ai_` prefix stays on the copies: a paid build's
# check_no_ai_assets.sh gate must still find them until Jesse's cleanup pass.
#
# deion_assets d9ecc155cab2be809b0b37a2c8aca16e85d52143
